<title>GERMANY: Schmidt sees no BayernLB merger.</title>
<headline>Schmidt sees no BayernLB merger.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The head of Germany's Bayerische Vereinsbank, Albrecht Schmidt, said on Monday that he did not expect the newly-formed Bayerische Hypo- und Vereinsbank AG to merge with Bayerische Landesbank.</p>
<p>Schmidt, whose vereinsbank will be merged with Bayerische Hypotheken und- Wechselbank, told a news conference that this was not a likely next move.</p>
<p>Asked about the possibility for further mergers or link-ups, for example with Dresdner Bank AG, Schmidt said: &quot;We are not joining in on such speculation.&quot;</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
